750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) metal shelving at front service line (food debris/dust);
B) sprayer (buildup - in crevice around sprayer surface);
C) bottom inside warmer (food splash);
D) metal prep table on cook line (general buildup/food - on top and bottom shelves);
E) scale on bottom shelf of metal prep table on cook line (debris);
F) green tray holding non-stick cooking sprays on top shelf of metal prep table on cook line (debris);
G) general surfaces of cooking equipment (splash/grease/general buildup - steamer, oven, fryers);
H) drip tray of flat top grill (food debris);
I) spice storage cart (debris);
J) drawer at table holding microwave (splash);    and
K) under slicer (pens/dust/food debris).  

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

